    thinking: "**Analyzing the Request Details**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the user\'s needs. I\'m focusing on dissecting the request for an audiovisual production agency\'s operating system and workflow platform. This means I am working to understand exactly what the user means by \"Modelo de Negocio, Roles y Permisos (RBAC)\", \"Gesti\303\263n de Marcas, Territorios y\".\n\n\n**Defining User Roles and Access**\n\nI\'m now clarifying the roles within the system. My focus is on breaking down each role, such as WebAdmin, Project Director, Collaborators and Clients. Each requires specific permissions to perform their respective functions effectively. This will now ensure a smooth workflow and robust security for all users.\n\n\n**Developing Role Simulation**\n\nI\'m now implementing a UI dynamic role switcher. This will allow me to test and refine the platform from the perspective of diverse users. I\'m focusing on ensuring each role, from project directors to collaborators, can seamlessly access and interact with the system. My next steps are creating the 4 example roles and the features available for them, such as \"co-creation\", review, and change requests.\n\n\n**Defining Equipment and Workflow**\n\nI\'m now integrating equipment inventory and availability. I\'m focusing on creating a robust allocation and reservation engine to prevent schedule conflicts by date. Also, visual cues will track each piece\'s status, ensuring seamless hardware management. Then, the deliverables\' lifecycle is being organized, from ideation to calendarization, and technical guides.\n\n\n**Integrating Technical Specifications**\n\nI am now focusing on the technical consolidation phase for the system, specifically the integration of technical specifications. I am working on the aspect ratios, color profiles, audio specifications, frame rates, lighting schemes, shotlists and gear kits. I\'ve also incorporated a strict 3-day change request window before publication to maintain deadline integrity. Integration with Gemini AI is also in progress, specifically the AI Idea Co-Creator, AI Technical Guide, and AI Compliance Evaluator. Additionally, I am designing a multidimensional Kanban board for improved project visualization.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 419226922
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
