    thinking: "**Verifying the Specifications**\n\nI\'ve confirmed the initial specifications. I\'ll provide both DBML and Mermaid formats for the ERD. I\'m focusing on interactive Mermaid viewers with SVG output and syntax highlighting for clarity. The DBML view will be included as well, as requested. I\'m working on integrating these to meet the prompt\'s requirements completely.\n\n\n**Developing the Interface**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the API contracts, crafting interactive schemas and a user-friendly endpoint explorer with copyable payloads. I\'m also building a mock dataset with interactive visual and raw JSON inspection for users. I\'m preparing an interactive UI, including a multidimensional Kanban board, dynamic dual calendar, and a brand/territory manager with validation. Finally, I\'m working on a detailed state machine with chronological triggers and transitions.\n\n\n**Constructing the Components**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in building out the React components. I\'ve started defining the file structure, and the `AppContext` with localStorage persistence is underway. Next, I\'ll tackle the `Navbar` with the Persona Switcher and filters. I\'ll work on the multidimensional `KanbanBoard` next. After this, I\'ll focus on the `DualCalendar`, the `BrandTerritoryManager`, and the `EquipmentManager`. Finally, the `TechnicalGuideViewer` will be next.\n\n\n"
