      text: "Apply the \"High Density\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: High Density\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'flex h-screen w-full bg-[#f1f3f5] text-[#343a40] font-sans text-xs overflow-hidden\'> <nav class=\'w-16 h-full bg-[#1a1c1e] flex flex-col items-center py-6 space-y-8 border-r border-[#2d2f31] flex-shrink-0\'> <div class=\'w-10 h-10 bg-blue-600 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl\'>AV</div> <div class=\'flex flex-col space-y-6\'> <div class=\'p-2 bg-slate-700/50 rounded cursor-pointer\'><svg class=\'w-5 h-5 text-white\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'currentColor\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\'><path stroke-linecap=\'round\' stroke-linejoin=\'round\' stroke-width=\'2\' d=\'M4 6h16M4 12h16m-7 6h7\'></path></svg></div> <div class=\'p-2 opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 cursor-pointer\'><svg class=\'w-5 h-5 text-slate-400\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'currentColor\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\'><path d=\'M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10\'></path></svg></d