    user_requests: "Here is the full initial file tree for the application:\n/.env.example\n/.gitignore\n/assets/.aistudio/.gitignore\n/index.html\n/metadata.json\n/package.json\n/src/App.tsx\n/src/index.css\n/src/main.tsx\n/tsconfig.json\n/vite.config.ts\n\nThe following dependencies are installed:\n@google/genai: ^2.4.0\n@tailwindcss/vite: ^4.1.14\n@vitejs/plugin-react: ^5.0.4\ndotenv: ^17.2.3\nexpress: ^4.21.2\nlucide-react: ^0.546.0\nmotion: ^12.23.24\nreact: ^19.0.1\nreact-dom: ^19.0.1\nvite: ^6.2.3\n\nThe following devDependencies are installed:\n@types/express: ^4.17.21\n@types/node: ^22.14.0\nautoprefixer: ^10.4.21\nesbuild: ^0.25.0\ntailwindcss: ^4.1.14\ntsx: ^4.21.0\ntypescript: ~5.8.2\nvite: ^6.2.3\n\nKey file contents:\n\n--- /.env.example ---\n```\n# GEMINI_API_KEY: Required for Gemini AI API calls.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime from user secrets.\n# Users configure this via the Secrets panel in the AI Studio UI.\nGEMINI_API_KEY=\"MY_GEMINI_API_KEY\"\n\n# APP_URL: The URL where this applet is hosted.\n# AI Studio automatically injects this at runtime with the Cloud Run service URL.\n# Used for self-referential links, OAuth callbacks, and API endpoints.\nAPP_URL=\"MY_APP_URL\"\n\n```\n\n--- /index.html ---\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>My Google AI Studio App</title>\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"An application built with Google AI Studio.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"My Google AI Studio App\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"An application built with Google AI Studio.\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n    <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.tsx\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>\n\n\n```\n\n--- /metadata.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"requestFramePermissions\": [],\n  \"majorCapabilities\": [\"MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API\"]\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/App.tsx ---\n```typescript\n/**\n * @license\n * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0\n */\n\nexport default function App() {\n  return <div></div>;\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /src/index.css ---\n```css\n@import \"tailwindcss\";\n\n```\n\n--- /src/main.tsx ---\n```typescript\nimport {StrictMode} from \'react\';\nimport {createRoot} from \'react-dom/client\';\nimport App from \'./App.tsx\';\nimport \'./index.css\';\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\'root\')!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <App />\n  </StrictMode>,\n);\n\n```\n\n--- /tsconfig.json ---\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2022\",\n    \"experimentalDecorators\": true,\n    \"useDefineForClassFields\": false,\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"lib\": [\n      \"ES2022\",\n      \"DOM\",\n      \"DOM.Iterable\"\n    ],\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true,\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"isolatedModules\": true,\n    \"moduleDetection\": \"force\",\n    \"allowJs\": true,\n    \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n    \"paths\": {\n      \"@/*\": [\n        \"./*\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"allowImportingTsExtensions\": true,\n    \"noEmit\": true\n  }\n}\n\n```\n\n--- /vite.config.ts ---\n```typescript\nimport tailwindcss from \'@tailwindcss/vite\';\nimport react from \'@vitejs/plugin-react\';\nimport path from \'path\';\nimport {defineConfig} from \'vite\';\n\nexport default defineConfig(() => {\n  return {\n    plugins: [react(), tailwindcss()],\n    resolve: {\n      alias: {\n        \'@\': path.resolve(__dirname, \'.\'),\n      },\n    },\n    server: {\n      // HMR is disabled in AI Studio via DISABLE_HMR env var.\n      // Do not modify\303\242\302\200\302\224file watching is disabled to prevent flickering during agent edits.\n      hmr: process.env.DISABLE_HMR !== \'true\',\n      // Disable file watching when DISABLE_HMR is true to save CPU during agent edits.\n      watch: process.env.DISABLE_HMR === \'true\' ? null : {},\n    },\n  };\n});\n\n```"
    user_requests: "Modelo de Negocio, Roles y Permisos (RBAC)\nWebAdmin: Control global del sistema, gesti\303\263n de organizaciones, configuraci\303\263n de infraestructura y m\303\251tricas de rendimiento.\nDirector de Proyecto: Aprobaciones finales, asignaci\303\263n de equipos de trabajo, balanceo de recursos t\303\251cnicos y gesti\303\263n de clientes.\nColaboradores (2 cupos en demo): Co-creaci\303\263n de ideas, ejecuci\303\263n t\303\251cnica audiovisual, actualizaci\303\263n de estados de entregables y solicitud de equipos.\nClientes (6 marcas en demo): Co-creaci\303\263n de ideas, revisi\303\263n de calendarios (producci\303\263n/publicaci\303\263n), visualizaci\303\263n de su gu\303\255a t\303\251cnica y solicitud de cambios bajo ventana temporal.\nGesti\303\263n de Marcas, Territorios y Activos\nTerritorios de Comunicaci\303\263n: CRUD con regla de negocio estricta: Cada cliente/marca debe tener al menos 3 territorios activos (validaci\303\263n frontend y backend).\nActivos Digitales de Marca: Registro de activos vinculados a cada cliente (Websites, Apps m\303\263viles, Landing pages, Cat\303\241logos).\nGesti\303\263n de Recursos T\303\251cnicos y Dispositivos (Equipamiento)\nM\303\263dulo de inventario y reserva de hardware para producci\303\263n audiovisual.\nMockear datos realistas: C\303\241maras, Lentes, Audio, Iluminaci\303\263n, Dispositivos de Captura M\303\263vil, Estaciones de Edici\303\263n.\nL\303\263gica de asignaci\303\263n: Bloqueo de equipos por fecha de rodaje/producci\303\263n con detecci\303\263n de colisiones de reserva.\nCiclo de Vida del Entregable y Automatizaci\303\263n de Calendarios\nFase de Ideaci\303\263n (D\303\255a 1 al 15 del mes): Co-creaci\303\263n colaborativa.\nFase de Calendarizaci\303\263n (D\303\255a 15 al 20 del mes): Definici\303\263n de Calendarios de Producci\303\263n y Publicaci\303\263n.\nFase de Gu\303\255a T\303\251cnica (D\303\255a 20 hasta 5 d\303\255as antes de fin de mes): Consolidaci\303\263n de requerimientos audiovisuales.\nRegla de Cambios en Publicaci\303\263n: Ventana de 3 d\303\255as antes (T-3) de la fecha l\303\255mite programada.\nEspecificaci\303\263n de Vistas y Experiencia de Usuario (UI/UX)\nTablero Kanban Multidimensional con filtros.\nVista de Calendario Din\303\241mico (1 mes pasado, 2 meses futuro).\nM\303\263dulo Gu\303\255a T\303\251cnica: Visor estructurado por entregable.\nEstructura de la Entrega Esperada\nDiagrama Entidad-Relaci\303\263n (ERD) en formato DBML o Mermaid.\nM\303\241quina de Estados y Transiciones: Tabla detallada de eventos, triggers cronol\303\263gicos y validaciones.\nContratos de API REST / Edge Functions (TypeScript/JSON).\nMock Dataset Inicial (JSON): 1 Director, 2 Colaboradores, 6 Clientes, 3+ Territorios por cliente, lista de equipos, 12 entregables muestra.\nEspero que esta documentaci\303\263n cumpla con tus expectativas. Si tienes alguna pregunta o necesitas algo m\303\241s, no dudes en comunic\303\241rmelo."
    user_requests: "Apply the \"High Density\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: High Density\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'flex h-screen w-full bg-[#f1f3f5] text-[#343a40] font-sans text-xs overflow-hidden\'> <nav class=\'w-16 h-full bg-[#1a1c1e] flex flex-col items-center py-6 space-y-8 border-r border-[#2d2f31] flex-shrink-0\'> <div class=\'w-10 h-10 bg-blue-600 rounded flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold text-xl\'>AV</div> <div class=\'flex flex-col space-y-6\'> <div class=\'p-2 bg-slate-700/50 rounded cursor-pointer\'><svg class=\'w-5 h-5 text-white\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'currentColor\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\'><path stroke-linecap=\'round\' stroke-linejoin=\'round\' stroke-width=\'2\' d=\'M4 6h16M4 12h16m-7 6h7\'></path></svg></div> <div class=\'p-2 opacity-50 hover:opacity-100 cursor-pointer\'><svg class=\'w-5 h-5 text-slate-400\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'currentColor\' viewBox=\'0 0 24 24\'><path d=\'M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10\'></path></