    session_summary: "# 1. Outstanding User Requests\n*   **Apply \"High Density\" Design Theme:** The user has requested a visual overhaul of the entire application to a \"High Density\" theme (light-mode centric, dense layout, specific typography).\n    *   **Status:** IMPLEMENTATION.\n    *   **Instructions:** Preserve existing HTML structure and functionality; modify only CSS/styling and layout containers.\n    *   **Remaining Scope:** Migrate individual components (`KanbanBoard`, `DualCalendar`, `BrandTerritoryManager`, `EquipmentManager`, `SystemSpecsHub`, `WebAdminDashboard`, `DeliverableDetailModal`, `AICopilotModal`).\n\n# 2. User Knowledge\n*   **Design Constraints:** The user explicitly mandated preserving the existing HTML structure and functionality while updating the visual layer.\n*   **Theme Source:** The user provided a complete HTML/CSS snippet representing the \"High Density\" theme, which includes a specific color palette (e.g., `#f1f3f5` background, `#1a1c1e` sidebar) and layout density (e.g., `text-xs`, `grid-cols-12`).\n*   **Scope:** The project is a \"Studio OS\" for managing creative workflows, including RBAC, Kanban boards, and equipment reservations.\n\n# 3. Work Accomplished\n*   **System Architecture (Prior Checkpoint):** Successfully implemented core CineFlow Studio OS, including RBAC, `WebAdminDashboard`, `SystemSpecsHub`, `App.tsx` routing, `initialData.ts`, and custom scrollbar infrastructure.\n*   **Visual Migration (Current Phase):**\n    *   **Global Styles:** Updated `/src/index.css` to define the new light-mode color palette, system typography, and scrollbar styles.\n    *   **Layout Shell:** Updated `/src/App.tsx` to use the new light background (`#f1f3f5`) and adjusted main viewport padding and footer styling.\n    *   **Navbar:** Updated `/src/components/Navbar.tsx` to match the High Density aesthetic (colors, spacing, and layout).\n\n# 4. Model Knowledge\n*   **Architecture & Interfaces:**\n    *   `AppContext` (in `src/context/AppContext.tsx`) remains the single source of truth for global state.\n    *   The UI relies on `lucide-react` for iconography and Tailwind CSS for styling.\n*   **Theme Shift:** The application is transitioning from a dark-mode centric (`bg-zinc-950`) to a light-mode centric (`bg-[#f1f3f5]`) design.\n*   **UI Patterns:** The application makes extensive use of modal-based interactions (`DeliverableDetailModal`, `AICopilotModal`, `EquipmentManager`).\n*   **Constraints:** Business logic (e.g., T-3 window alerts, equipment collision detection) must remain intact during the visual migration.\n\n# 5. Files and Code\n*   **Edited Files:**\n    *   `/src/index.css`: Updated global body styles, scrollbars, and typography.\n    *   `/src/App.tsx`: Updated main layout shell, background, and footer.\n    *   `/src/components/Navbar.tsx`: Updated component styling to High Density theme.\n*   **Viewed Files (Relevant for Theme Migration):**\n    *   `/src/components/KanbanBoard.tsx`: Contains the primary board view. Needs migration to the new color palette and layout density.\n    *   `/src/components/WebAdminDashboard.tsx`: Contains health stats and RBAC matrix. Needs migration.\n    *   `/src/components/SystemSpecsHub.tsx`: Contains technical docs. Needs migration.\n\n# 6. Current Work and Next Steps\n*   **Current Work:** We have successfully migrated the global shell and the `Navbar`. The next logical step is to migrate the main content components.\n*   **Next Steps:**\n    1.  **Migrate `KanbanBoard.tsx`:** This is the most critical and complex component. It requires updating the column headers, card styling, and filter bar to match the new High Density light-mode aesthetic.\n    2.  **Migrate `WebAdminDashboard.tsx`:** Update the health stats cards and RBAC table to the new visual style.\n    3.  **Migrate remaining modals/components:** Iteratively apply the theme to `DeliverableDetailModal`, `AICopilotModal`, etc."
