  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Updating the Calendar Design**\n\nI\'m working on updating the `DualCalendar.tsx` component. The initial focus is on implementing the High Density light palette. I\'ve started with the header, applying styles for background, border, rounded corners, padding, and shadow. Now, the plan is to move onto the month switchers and toggles, considering bg, border, and text colors. I\'ll need to figure out what the best bg for the legend info box.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
