l space-y-2\'> <h4 class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-blue-400 uppercase border-b pb-1\'>Gu\303\255a T\303\251cnica (3)</h4> <div class=\'p-2 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded\'> <p class=\'font-semibold text-[11px] text-blue-800\'>Post-producci\303\263n Masterclass</p> <p class=\'text-[9px] text-blue-600 mt-1\'>Requiere Hardware 4K</p> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col space-y-2\'> <h4 class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-orange-400 uppercase border-b pb-1\'>Producci\303\263n (2)</h4> <div class=\'p-2 bg-orange-50 border border-orange-100 rounded relative\'> <div class=\'absolute top-2 right-2 w-2 h-2 bg-red-500 rounded-full animate-pulse\'></div> <p class=\'font-semibold text-[11px] text-orange-800\'>Rodaje Lumina Principal</p> <p class=\'text-[9px] text-orange-600 mt-1\'>T-3 Window Closing</p> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col space-y-2\'> <h4 class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-green-400 uppercase border-b pb-1\'>Finalizado (3)</h4> <div class=\'p-2 bg-green-50 border border-green-100 rounded opacity-70\'> <p class=\'font-semibold text-[11px] text-green-800\'>Teaser Social Media #02</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> </main> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
  }
}
